            <title>[IGNITE-10615] Ignite Compatibility: fix arguments&apos; checking in the node runner</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10615</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is the checking of arguments number In &lt;tt&gt;IgniteCompatibilityNodeRunner#main&lt;/tt&gt;, which expected at least 3 arguments, but in actual code at least 5 arguments are required.&lt;br/&gt;
